    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0142" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg68"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 7, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose a copy of a
                    telegram of yesterday from M M. Jackson, esq., the consul of the United States
                    at Halifax, in regard to a projected raid from Canada into the United States. I
                    will thank you to call the attention of the authorities of that province to the
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your obedient</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d112-a1.xml" xpointer="d112-a1"/>
            </div>
